error[L0728]: library `lib-outside` names a `:lib` outside its checkout
 --> project.knv:1:29
  |
1 | (defproject app (libraries (lib-outside :git "../lib-outside.git" :rev "25b372bbd2ed664c3b508df050907eecc816857c")))
  |                             ^^^^^^^^^^^ this git library's project file reaches outside it
  |
  = note: a library fetched from git may only name files inside its own checkout
  = help: ask the library's authors to use a relative `:lib` without `..`
